check 1
# Whirlwind clicked ON the Fallen (unit target): ScnBar (expansion Barbarian, level 30, every skill at 20, right
# skill 151), -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant
# blood-moor-empty: no monster population there) before frame 4,
# a Fallen (class 19) 4 sub-tiles away along +x (client pixel about 496, 296) before frame 10, then one right
# click at client pixel on the Fallen (rclickunit 1 19: the unit under the cursor, so a unit-form message), before frame 20's drain. Compares the cast
# (mode, states, stats), its missiles' effects on the Fallen and the
# draws. Area F2 (q-diff-skills-2). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name bar-whirlwind-unit
save ScnBar --class bar --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 151
seed 1234
ticks 70
seconds 300
channels state packets
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 19 @x+4 @y normal
input frame 20; rclickunit 1 19
